      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Moovingo are delighted to present this superb 1st floor apartment to the market. Fully refurbished since 2020, the apartment is in excellent condition throughout. The apartment looks out over beautiful green surrounds and the calming sounds of the River Liffey can be enjoyed from the balcony. Superbly located by Chapelizod Village, the apartment will appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, open plan kitchen/living room, adjoining balcony, two double bedroooms, modern family bathroom and hot press/storage. Residents have permit parking with ample spaces available.\r\n\r\nArea Info:\r\n\r\nThe Steeples is a modern development situated in the picturesque village of Chapelizod. Located on the banks of the River Liffey, Chapelizod has all the charm and character of a small village while still being within close proximity to the city centre.\r\n\r\nThe village has a host of amenities including cafes, restaurants, bars, schools and leisure clubs. The beautiful surrounds of the Phoenix Park are a stone's throw away while the War Memorial Gardens are also within each reach.\r\n\r\nTransport links are excellent with numerous bus routes operating nearby into and out of the city centre. Heuston Station is also close by and the city centre is just a 15 minute cycle. The N4 and M50 motorways are also easily accessed within minutes.\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Any intending purchaser(s) shall accept that no statement, description or measurement contained in advertisement or any other document or published by the vendor or by Moovingo, in respect of the premises shall constitute a representation inducing the purchaser(s) to enter into any contract for sale, or any warranty forming part of any such contract for sale. Any such statement, description or measurement, whether in writing or in oral form, given by the vendor, or by Moovingo, are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any intending purchaser(s) shall satisfy themselves by inspection, survey or otherwise as to the correctness of same. No omission, misstatement, misdescription, incorrect measurement or error of any description, whether given orally or in any written form by the vendor or by Moovingo, shall give rise to any claim for compensation against the vendor or against Moovingo. Any intending purchaser(s) are deemed to fully satisfy themselves in relation to all such matters."
      },
